    "name": "queensland-imagery-aerial-ortho-public-time-series-service-json",
    "notes": "A time series image service that displays authoritative general reference imagery captured by remotely piloted aircraft systems (drones) and piloted aircraft over areas of Queensland. This service is designed to provide public access to the State Remotely Sensed Image Library collection prior to the year 2017, over some areas of the state. This high resolution ortho photo imagery is over three years old and is made available for public use by the Department of Resources, Queensland. The service is to be used in dynamic mode to filter and display individual imagery project areas. If you would like to receive updates for new projects, functionality or planned downtime please subscribe here: http://ems.gs/3qln0iYbIYQ.",
